        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>『The Sushi House』</i>is a first-person, story-driven game set in an ordinary sushi restaurant.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the midst of familiar routines and a quiet atmosphere, a subtle sense of unease begins to creep in.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3687470/extras/b57aa472a17f1773141a49b3a99312dc.poster.avif?t=1772711215\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3687470/extras/b57aa472a17f1773141a49b3a99312dc.webm?t=1772711215\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3687470/extras/b57aa472a17f1773141a49b3a99312dc.mp4?t=1772711215\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A Part-Time Job Begins</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You start your new part-time job at the sushi house.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A co-worker shows you the ropes, and you spend your day preparing sushi,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > cleaning the floor, and managing the shop.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At first, everything seems normal. But as you go about your daily tasks,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >a strange feeling begins to settle in—like something isn’t quite right.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And slowly, that feeling draws you deeper into the mystery of the place.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3687470/extras/548c9dea92477a2e7b1c0b1f38192bf5.poster.avif?t=1772711215\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3687470/extras/548c9dea92477a2e7b1c0b1f38192bf5.webm?t=1772711215\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3687470/extras/548c9dea92477a2e7b1c0b1f38192bf5.mp4?t=1772711215\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >First-person, immersive gameplay</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Realistic sushi-making and shop management systems</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A quiet, unsettling atmosphere that gradually intensifies</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Interactive dialogue and narrative-driven storytelling</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A short but impactful experience (approximately 2 hours)</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Recommended Play Environment</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Headphones or earphones strongly recommended</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Disclaimer</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game is a work of fiction and has no relation to any real companies, brands, or trademarks.</p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>『The Sushi House』</i>is a first-person, story-driven game set in an ordinary sushi restaurant.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the midst of familiar routines and a quiet atmosphere, a subtle sense of unease begins to creep in.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3687470/extras/b57aa472a17f1773141a49b3a99312dc.poster.avif?t=1772711215\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3687470/extras/b57aa472a17f1773141a49b3a99312dc.webm?t=1772711215\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3687470/extras/b57aa472a17f1773141a49b3a99312dc.mp4?t=1772711215\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A Part-Time Job Begins</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You start your new part-time job at the sushi house.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A co-worker shows you the ropes, and you spend your day preparing sushi,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > cleaning the floor, and managing the shop.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At first, everything seems normal. But as you go about your daily tasks,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >a strange feeling begins to settle in—like something isn’t quite right.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And slowly, that feeling draws you deeper into the mystery of the place.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3687470/extras/548c9dea92477a2e7b1c0b1f38192bf5.poster.avif?t=1772711215\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3687470/extras/548c9dea92477a2e7b1c0b1f38192bf5.webm?t=1772711215\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3687470/extras/548c9dea92477a2e7b1c0b1f38192bf5.mp4?t=1772711215\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >First-person, immersive gameplay</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Realistic sushi-making and shop management systems</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A quiet, unsettling atmosphere that gradually intensifies</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Interactive dialogue and narrative-driven storytelling</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A short but impactful experience (approximately 2 hours)</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Recommended Play Environment</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Headphones or earphones strongly recommended</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Disclaimer</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game is a work of fiction and has no relation to any real companies, brands, or trademarks.</p>",
